        {
          "term": "cut starts",
          "heading": false
        }
      ],
      "extract": "The perturbative series ${\\cal D}^{\\{\\}}(g)$ and the non-perturbative correction ${\\cal D}^{\\{1\\}}(g)$ are related by resurgence relations, see [@Marino:2012zq; @Dorigoni:2014hea; @Aniceto:2018bis] for modern references. This correspondence originates from ambiguity cancellations and are manifested in asymptotic relations: the large order behaviour of the peturbative coefficients ${\\cal D}_{k}^{\\{\\}}$ are related to",
      "extractCut": true
    },
