      ],
      "extract": "In this Letter we derived the complete trans-series for semi-infinite determinants associated with the Bessel kernel, generalizations of the Tracy--Widom distributions that appear in many contexts, including observables of ${\\cal N}=4$ super Yang--Mills theory. We found that the non-perturbative corrections exhibit a special structure: each non-perturbative scale enters only linearly, and the corrections can be",
